The '''Yavin system''' was a [[star system]] located in the [[Gordian Reach]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> The first [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star]] was [[Battle of Yavin|destroyed]] in a major battle over [[Yavin 4]], a moon located within the system.<ref name="Episode IV" />

The system was the namesake of the [[Yavin Code]], which was determined at the [[Yavin Convention]].<ref name="TBB">{{TCW|The Big Bang}}</ref>

